{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10098","headline":"奉和常阁老晚秋集贤院即事寄赠徐薛二侍郎 · 包佶","name":"奉和常阁老晚秋集贤院即事寄赠徐薛二侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秘殿掖垣西，书楼苑树齐。\n秋烟凝缥帙，晓色上璇题。\n门接承明近，池连太液低。\n疎钟文马驻，繁叶彩禽栖。\n职美纶江綍，荣深组及珪。\n九霄偏眷顾，三事早提携。\n对案临青玉，窥书捧紫泥。\n始欢新遇重，还惜旧游暌。\n左宦登吴岫，分家渡越溪。\n赋中频叹鵩，卜处几听鸡。\n望阙应多恋，临津不用迷。\n柏梁思和曲，朝夕候金闺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"包佶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10098.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10098","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}